    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": " WF3 OVERVIEW \n## WF3 — Operational Logging & Governance\nARIA — Automated Incident Response System v2.0\n\nWORKFLOW PURPOSE:\nReceives run metadata from WF1 (on error) or WF2\n(on success or rejection). Assembles a complete\ngovernance record and writes one row to Run Logs tab.\n\nNODE FLOW:\nWhen Executed by Another Workflow (from WF1 or WF2)\n  → Set — Assemble Run Metadata (23 fields)\n  → Google Sheets — Write Run Logs (append)\n\nTHREE ENTRY SCENARIOS:\n1. WF1 Log Error → processing_status = failed\n   pipeline_stage_reached = WF1 — AI Agent error\n   overall_run_health = FAILED\n\n2. WF2 Log Rejection → processing_status = pending_review\n   pipeline_stage_reached = WF3 — Governance Log\n   overall_run_health = PENDING REVIEW\n\n3. WF2 Log Success → processing_status = success\n   pipeline_stage_reached = WF3 — Governance Log\n   overall_run_health = HEALTHY\n\nANSWERS: What happened last Friday?\nOne row per execution tells the full story.\n\nRUBRIC CRITERIA COVERED:\nC4 — Full operational governance log\nC2 — Always runs regardless of WF1/WF2 outcome",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 496
      },
